    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tho p'ogwaŋe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, “Kidhi bongi Farawo iwaci rigo ni, Rwoth, Were pa Joebulaniya waco ni, ‘Weyi ji paran jokadhi, ŋey jowolaman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole k'inokwer weyo jo kadho kendo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neni, abino miyin gir'acula gi dhiro two kwoŋ ogwaŋe mewin je; kayina mewin, ŋamia, dhok, rombo, kodi diegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rwoth bino ketho pokirok i dier ogwaŋe pa Joisiraili kodi apa Jomisir, ŋey wongoye kad'acel kwoŋ ogwaŋe pa Joisiraili ma wotho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An, Rwoth, aketho dikin paka ndelo m'abino timo iye gime.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo ma yawere Rwoth otimo paka owaco, aka ogwaŋe pa Jomisir je jotho, to ngoye ogwaŋ kad'acel pa Joisiraili ma otho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Farawo openjo gim'otimere t'iwaco rigo nike ongoye ogwaŋ kad'acel pa Joisiraili ma otho. To go fodi obedo gi wictek aka k'oweyo ji kadho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bur",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Rwoth owaco ri Musa gi Aron ni, “Jow win buru adhoŋ cingi win wok i mac malieth, aka weyi Musa woywoy i koyo ruwaŋ Farawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buru no bino ywore pa rudino m'onuŋere i lowo ma Misir gibe, aka kisi kamoro jolanywolo bur ma lokere adhola kwoŋ ji g'ogwaŋe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.16.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 16:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno jokwanyo buru moro to jocungo ruwaŋ Farawo; aka Musa oywoyo i koyo; to buru no nywolo bur m'olokere adhola kwoŋ ji g'ogwaŋe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jothieth jok'onyalo neno ruwaŋ Musa kwoŋbedo kwoŋ jo bende oyido oumere gi bur paka Jomisir man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rwoth omiyo Farawo bedo gi wictek paka Rwoth oyido owaco, aka Farawo k'owinjo Musa gi Aron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, “Cew dikin odikin maŋic, icungi ruwaŋ Farawo aka iwaci rigo ni, Rwoth, Were pa Joebulaniya waco ni, ‘Weyi ji paran jokadhi, ŋey jowolaman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole rume, aladhiro thoyamo paran kwoŋin, jodhum perin kodi ji perin, ŋey inyal ŋeyo nike ongoye ŋata cale an i piny gibe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabedi nende atiŋ cingan t'agoyin gi ji perin gi two nundu, dinyo wijoje wirere kicutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "T'aweyo wikwo r'atoŋa me, nyutho meni paran, ŋey nyingan wotuci i piny gibe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kucel fodi itiŋere malo kwoŋ ji paran aka ikwero jowokadhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni, dikin kapa sawa me, abino miyo pe mapek swa cwe, nger m'oyido fodi k'ocwe i Misir wok con. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo riameno wodhi or, ŋey ogwaŋe mewin gi kisi gima nitie kam'othangere wokethi i ot. Pe bino cwe kwoŋ ji kodi ogwaŋe ma jodoŋ woko, aka jobino tho.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Megi kwoŋ jodhum pa Farawo lworo omako jo ro gima Rwoth oyido owaco, aka jokelo ŋecin pajo g'ogwaŋe pajo i udi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To megi ma jok'odewo kwoŋ wac pa Rwoth joweyo ŋecin pajo g'ogwaŋe kam'othangere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, “Riey cingin yupolo, ŋey pe wocwe i lowo ma Misir gipi, kwoŋ ji, ogwaŋe, kodi cemo ma ndelin je.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Musa orieyo luth pere yupolo, aka Rwoth odhiro mwoc koth, pe, aka lithkoth ogoyo piny. Rwoth odhiro ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pe mapek gi lithkoth ma kicoki. Manago obedo pe m'oyido fodi k'ocwe i Misir wok con. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I Misir gipi pe ogoyo kisi gimoro m'oyido nitie kam'othangere, kiri gi ji kodi ogwaŋe. Pe ogoyo piny cemo i ndelin to turo woko yen je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaka iy'adec ma Gosen, kama Joisiraili oyido jobed'iye ama pe oyido ongoye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Farawo ooro wolwoŋi Musa gi Aron, aka owaco rijo ni, “Rume atimo reco; Rwoth otire aka an gi ji paran wakom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
