        {
          "text": "Musa owaco rigo ni, “Tekin aweyo tindi madwoŋ, abino rieyo cingan ri Rwoth; mwoc koth bino coki, aka pe bino ngoye, ŋey inyal ŋeyo nike piny obedo apa Rwoth. ",
